<!DOCTYPE task PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Task//EN" "task.dtd">
<task id="task-9955" class="- topic/topic task/task "><title class="- topic/title ">Reporting a lost or stolen card</title><shortdesc class="- topic/shortdesc ">Learn how to report and deactivate a lost or stolen <keyword conkeyref="varsProductnames/009" class="- topic/keyword "/>.</shortdesc><taskbody class="- topic/body task/taskbody "><context class="- topic/section task/context "><p class="- topic/p ">A card that is lost or stolen must be deactivated. This stops any unauthorized charges from being made.</p></context><steps class="- topic/ol task/steps "><stepsection class="- topic/li task/stepsection ">Deactivate the card</stepsection><step conref="../../../../Content_Warehouses/MyGeotab/MyGeotab_steps_warehouse.dita#task-6042/step-901" class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd "/></step><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Go to <uicontrol class="+ topic/ph ui-d/uicontrol ">Cards</uicontrol>.</cmd></step><step conref="../../../../Content_Warehouses/MyGeotab/MyGeotab_steps_warehouse.dita#task-6042/step-7473" class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd "/></step><step conref="../../../../Content_Warehouses/MyGeotab/MyGeotab_steps_warehouse.dita#task-6042/step-7948" class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd "/></step><stepsection class="- topic/li task/stepsection ">Report the incident</stepsection><step class="- topic/li task/step "><cmd class="- topic/ph task/cmd ">Contact Support to report the incident and get help with any unauthorized charges: <ph conref="../../../../Content_Warehouses/MyGeotab/MyG_content_reuse.dita#concept-5809/ph-1098" class="- topic/ph "/> or <ph conref="../../../../Content_Warehouses/MyGeotab/MyG_content_reuse.dita#concept-5809/ph-1316" class="- topic/ph "/>.</cmd></step></steps><result class="- topic/section task/result "><p class="- topic/p ">The card is deactivated and the incident is reported.</p></result><postreq class="- topic/section task/postreq "><p class="- topic/p ">Order a replacement card. A virtual card is ready right away. A physical card takes 7 to 10 business days to arrive. See <xref keyref="orderingPhysicalCards" class="- topic/xref ">Ordering physical cards</xref> or <xref keyref="issueVirtualCards" class="- topic/xref ">Issuing a virtual card</xref>.</p></postreq></taskbody></task>